  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**What this dashboard answers:** where does retrieval spend time, and which stage is degrading?\n\n* Source: Prometheus histograms `retrieval_duration_seconds`, `retrieval_candidates_count`, `query_duration_seconds` and `query_hits_count`, plus the counter `retrieval_degradations_total`. Aggregates only.\n* **Stage Duration (avg / p99):** one line per stage: `lexical` (term match), `semantic` (embeddings), `rerank`, `total`. The stage whose p99 grows is the bottleneck.\n* **Pipeline Degradation Rate:** how often a stage was unavailable, by `stage` and `reason`. Anything above zero means answers are coming from a reduced pipeline. Fix the stage (embedder, reranker, vector store) before judging result quality.\n* **Candidates per Stage (avg):** how many candidates each stage returned. `lexical` near 0 while `semantic` is healthy points to a keyword coverage gap; both near 0 means little matching content.\n* **Memory-Store Query Duration / Hits (avg):** the same numbers for the `/query` endpoint only.\n* These averages hide individual queries. To see the exact queries that found nothing, with labels and filters, open **Mem0 — Query Misses**."
      }
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "id": 1,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Stage Latency",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Retrieval Stage Duration (avg)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(retrieval_duration_seconds_sum[$__rate_interval]) / rate(retrieval_duration_seconds_count[$__rate_interval])",
          "legendFormat": "{{stage}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Average seconds per stage: lexical, semantic, rerank, total."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Retrieval Stage Duration (p99)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 11
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(retrieval_duration_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])) by (le, stage))",
          "legendFormat": "{{stage}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Slowest 1% per stage. The stage whose p99 grows is the bottleneck."
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19
      },
      "id": 4,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Degradations & Candidates",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Pipeline Degradation Rate",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "cps",
          "custom": {
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth"
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
